Hi Meradith, here's some information about our situation:
My wife and I will be in Boise starting from the 29th of September. I 
start working on the 5th of October. We will have temporary housing for 
30 days. We'd like to go on tours for apartments between the 29th and 
the 2nd of October, before I start working. Any day within that period 
is okay for us. Our plan is to finalize the permanent housing contract 
and move in slightly before our temporary housing expires.
These are the areas we are looking for:

     1. Walking distance to Julius Kleiner Park: at the east of it there
        is a lot of food options and a mall + grocery store
     2. Walkig distance to Kathryn Albertson Park / Ann Morrison Park /
        Central Lim
     3. Garden City

*Note that if you have better suggestions we are open for it.* Our 
paramters are: walking distance to a city park, grocery store with pick 
up option (albertsons or walmart supercenter), food options and good to 
have gym and/or mall.

These are the appointments I have scheduleed so far with in bold the 
ones we are really interested in them:

  * 29 September:
      o Crosshatch apartments
      o *Village apartments (1st best)*
      o **The regency **
  * 30 September (all day):
      o Townhomes at the Silo
      o River Point apartments
      o The Pines
      o Herons hedge apartments
  * 1 October:
      o District parkcenter
  * 2 October:
      o Legacy apartments
      o Sleepy Hollow apartments
  * 3 October:
      o Dovetail apartments
      o Whitewater Park

  *


*Parkway Apartm,enets*, *Stonethrow Apartmenets*, The Martha, 27th 
street crossing, Village East Apartments & Townhomes,** River Walk 
apartments** still to be sheduledfor tour.

Our budget 2k$ a month total but we target for around 1.5k for one 
bedroom. We mainly are lookign fro one bedroom but we would also 
pleasently consider good deals for 2 bedrooms. What we care about is a 
well kept, good value, modern, good position unit with AC, dishwasher, 
washing machine, fridge.

Hope this is all, feel free to contact me anytime.

Giulio


